Package: misclassifyr
Title: Estimation and Inference for Models of Misclassification
Version: 0.3.2
Authors@R:
    person("Ross", "Mattheis", , "ramattheis@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-3709-2271"))
Description: Maximum likelihood estimation and inference for models of
    misclassification, in which a discrete latent outcome is observed only
    through two noisy measures, as described in Mattheis (2024). The package
    supplies tabulation helpers, a menu of parametric and non-parametric
    models for the misclassification distribution, delta-method standard
    errors and Monte Carlo confidence sets for a downstream regression
    coefficient, and a fast expectation-maximization estimator for the
    record-linkage model when the outcome has thousands of categories.
